# Contact shadows, step 0 (../README.md, "Замер контактных теней"): close-ups of what stands on a surface, as the
# game draws it. Things by a candle, the hero's face and feet at a torch, his feet on the market's cobbles in the
# noon sun, in the evening shade and at a lantern at night, his feet in the meadow's grass.
# Three runs of the same shots:
#   the game       OPENGOTHIC_RT=1
#   the reference  OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_VSM=0   lamps and the sun take their shadow from a ray through the ray
#                  scene: exact for the world's mesh and static objects; items, the hero and grass are not in it
#   without GI     OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=0    the ambient light takes SSAO instead of the probes
# all with OPENGOTHIC_LIGHT_FREEZE=1 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<the working
# content>: scripts/bench.sh reports/render-features/2026-11-15-night-interiors/tools/contact-shadow.bench <out>
# Sheets: tools/contact_sheets.py <game> <reference> <without GI> <out dir>
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
blink off
overlay off
# 1. Xardas' tower, the torch: the hero's face, then his feet on the floor
set time 12 0
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam cut
cam face 70 0 1
wait 2500
shot face-front
wait 400
cam cut
cam face 70 45 1
wait 2500
shot face-34
wait 400
cam cut
ui off
view full
cam lift off
cam cut
cam look 12
cam world 110 30 0
wait 300
cam hold
wait 2500
shot tower-feet-0
wait 400
cam look 12
cam world 110 30 120
wait 300
cam hold
wait 2500
shot tower-feet-120
wait 400
cam look 90
cam world 300 140 30
wait 300
cam hold
wait 2500
shot tower-wide
wait 400
